     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <div><br></div><div>I have the same issue as Jess Thrift posted on the 25th. The app works locally but when deployed I get the sanitised error message: &quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">ERROR: An error has occurred. Check your logs or contact the app author for clarification.&quot;</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">H</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">ere the log form the deploy tab in Rstudio:</span></div><div><pre style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;box-sizing:border-box;width:850px;padding:6px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Osaka-Mono!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Preparing to deploy application...</span><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">DONE\r\nUploading bundle for application: 151919...</span></pre><pre style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;box-sizing:border-box;width:850px;padding:6px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Osaka-Mono!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\">[Here are a couple of Error messages, </span>but that wasn&#39;t a problem previously...</pre><pre style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;box-sizing:border-box;width:850px;padding:6px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Osaka-Mono!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">e.g. <i>&quot;Error in eval(expr, envir, enclos) : could not find function &quot;</i></pre><pre style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;box-sizing:border-box;width:850px;padding:6px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Osaka-Mono!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">]</pre><pre style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;box-sizing:border-box;width:850px;padding:6px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Osaka-Mono!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\">\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">DONE\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Deploying bundle: 1001170 for application: 151919 ...\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Waiting for task: 489900142\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">  building: Parsing manifest\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">  building: Installing system dependencies\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">  building: Fetching packages\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">  building: Installing packages\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">  building: Installing files\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">  building: Pushing image: 999730\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">  deploying: Starting instances\r\n</span><span styl